Window Taskbar (windowtaskbar@italian-brainrot.github.io)

This is a fork of "App Icons Taskbar" (aztaskbar) 31.4
(https://gitlab.com/AndrewZaech/aztaskbar, "azaech), GPL-3.0-or-later,
from which the panel, favourite-icon, DnD, preview and preferences code
is taken. The fork replaces the grouped running-app list with one button
per open window (with a title) and adds the window-button preferences.

Upstream of the fork base is not affiliated with this fork; any bug in
this fork is ours.
